./ R 00278000          $ 00278100 100                                           
         MVC   2(2,R14),IOINTPRM+2 INTERRUPTING DEVICE ADDR    XA0012DK         
./ R 00288000          $ 00288010 010                                           
*  ESA/390 STORES NO CSW. ON S/370 THE I/O INTERRUPTION        XA0012DK         
*  ITSELF STORED ONE AT X'40'; THE CHANNEL SUBSYSTEM KEEPS     XA0012DK         
*  THE STATUS IN THE SUBCHANNEL AND MAKES TEST SUBCHANNEL THE  XA0012DK         
*  ONLY WAY TO FETCH IT. THIS MODULE READS CSW AT ABOUT FORTY  XA0012DK         
*  SITES, SO FETCH IT ONCE HERE AND LET THEM ALL GO ON         XA0012DK         
*  READING X'40' -- THE SAME BARGAIN IOSXCC1 MAKES, AND X'40'  XA0012DK         
*  IS UNASSIGNED IN ESA/390 SO IT IS OURS TO SPEND.            XA0012DK         
*  THE COPY IS EXACT, NOT APPROXIMATE. THE SCSW'S              XA0012DK         
*  DEVICE-STATUS AND SUBCHANNEL-STATUS BYTES CARRY THE SAME    XA0012DK         
*  EIGHT BITS IN THE SAME ORDER AS THE CSW'S UNIT-STATUS AND   XA0012DK         
*  CHANNEL-STATUS BYTES, SO THE FORTY TM AND CLI TESTS         XA0012DK         
*  DOWNSTREAM NEED NO TRANSLATION. BYTE 0 GOES TO ZERO: KEY,   XA0012DK         
*  SLI AND CC HAVE NO ESA/390 COUNTERPART, WHICH MAKES THE     XA0012DK         
*  LOGOUT-PENDING TEST AT 00522000 ALWAYS FALSE.               XA0012DK         
*  THE WORK IRB IS STATIC, UNLIKE EVERY OTHER XAIOB AREA, AND  XA0012DK         
*  HAS TO BE: DMKSCNRU HAS NOT RUN YET, SO THERE IS NO IOBLOK  XA0012DK         
*  TO PUT IT IN. IT IS SAFE BECAUSE THE I/O NEW PSW IS         XA0012DK         
*  000C0000 -- I/O MASKED OFF -- SO NO SECOND I/O INTERRUPT    XA0012DK         
*  CAN BE TAKEN BEFORE THIS FINISHES.                          XA0012DK         
*  R1 IS FREE: THE LAST CARD BELOW LOADS IT ANYWAY. THE SID    XA0012DK         
*  THE HARDWARE STORED AT X'B8' IS ALREADY IN THE FORM TSCH    XA0012DK         
*  WANTS, X'0001' || SUBCHANNEL NUMBER, SO NO SCAN IS NEEDED.  XA0012DK         
*  TSCH'S CONDITION CODE IS DISCARDED: THE LH DOES NOT SET     XA0012DK         
*  ONE AND DMKSCNRU SETS ITS OWN BEFORE 00290000 TESTS IT.     XA0012DK         
         L     R1,IOSSID      SUBSYSTEM ID OF THIS INTERRUPT   XA0012DK         
         TSCH  IOTXIRB        FETCH THE STATUS S/370 STORED    XA0012DK         
         MVI   CSW,X'00'      KEY, SLI AND CC DO NOT SURVIVE   XA0012DK         
         MVC   CSW+1(3),IOTXIRB+5  CCW ADDRESS                 XA0012DK         
         MVC   CSW+4(4),IOTXIRB+8  STATUS AND COUNT            XA0012DK         
         LH    R1,IOINTPRM+2  INTERRUPTING UNIT'S ADDRESS      XA0012DK         
./ R 00304140          $ 00304145 005                                           
         CLC   IOBRADD(2),IOINTPRM+2 IS THIS FOR US?           XA0012DK         
./ R 00304420          $ 00304425 005                                           
         CLC   IOBRADD(2),IOINTPRM+2 IS THIS ONE FOR US?       XA0012DK         
./ R 00324000          $ 00324100 100                                           
         LH    R3,IOINTPRM+2  ALSO THE DEVICE ADDRESS.         XA0012DK         
./ R 00346000          $ 00346010 010                                           
*  WAS LCTL C2,C2,TEMPSAVE -- MASK THE FAILING CHANNEL. I-73.  XA0012DK         
         DS    0H             THE LCTL IS GONE                 XA0012DK         
./ R 00369000          $ 00369010 010                                           
*  WAS LCTL C2,C2,TEMPSAVE -- AND RESTORE IT.                  XA0012DK         
         DS    0H             THE LCTL IS GONE                 XA0012DK         
./ R 00410100          $ 00410110 010                                           
         CLC   IOINTPRM+2(2),IOBRADD                           XA0012DK         
./ R 00513000          $ 00513100 100                                           
         LH    R1,IOINTPRM+2  ADDR. OF INTERRUPTING UNIT       XA0012DK         
./ R 00514000          $ 00514010 010                                           
         XABTIO               IN CASE CHANNEL END WITH IT.     XA0012DK         
./ R 00515000          $ 00515010 010                                           
RSIO     XABSIO               NOW CLEAR CONTENTION             XA0012DK         
./ R 00846000          $ 00846100 100                                           
         LH    R4,IOINTPRM+2  SAVE INTERRUPT DEVICE ADDR.      XA0012DK         
./ R 00864000          $ 00864100 100                                           
         CLC   IOINTPRM+2(2),2(R14) IS IT PRIMARY CONSOLE?     XA0012DK         
./ R 00873000          $ 00873100 100                                           
         CLC   IOINTPRM+2(2),2(R14) ALTERNATE CONSOLE?         XA0012DK         
./ R 01053000          $ 01053010 010                                           
         XABTIO               SEE IF IT'S REALLY BUSY          XA0012DK         
./ R 01063300          $ 01063310 010                                           
         XABTIO               IS IT BUSY ?                     XA0012DK         
./ R 01079000          $ 01079010 010                                           
IOTNSIO  XABSIO               ATTEMPT TO DO SENSE              XA0012DK         
./ I 01159000 $ 01159010 010                                                    
*  XAIOB WORK AREAS AND SHIMS. REENTRANT BY CONSTRUCTION: THE  XA0012DK         
*  ORB, IRB AND REGISTER SAVE AREA ALL LIVE IN THE IOBLOK,     XA0012DK         
*  AND THE SUBCHANNEL COMES FROM RDEVSSID RATHER THAN A SCAN.  XA0012DK         
         XAIOBWRK             XAIOB SHIMS                      XA0012DK         
*  AND THE ONE STATIC EXCEPTION, FOR THE TSCH AT 00288000:     XA0012DK         
*  THE FIRST-LEVEL INTERRUPT HANDLER HAS NO IOBLOK YET. DS     XA0012DK         
*  16F IS THE FULL IRB -- SCSW, ESW AND ECW -- AND             XA0012DK         
*  FULLWORD-ALIGNED, WHICH TSCH REQUIRES. ONLY THE SCSW IS     XA0012DK         
*  READ. I-175.                                                XA0012DK         
IOTXIRB  DS    16F            IRB FOR THE INTERRUPT PATH       XA0012DK         
./ I 01170000 $ 01170010 010                                                    
         COPY  XABLOKS        FOR ORBCCWFM                     XA0012DK         
